+#   · the keys the phone recorded (DM_SHADER_USED: a folder of *.keys files, one key a line, which the host writes for every shader the map lacks: nvn_mtl.m shader_record_miss);
+#   · in every variant group (one stage of one pass of one Shader), the variant(s) with the fewest keywords, so every shader draws from the first run, if not in the right variant;
+#   · predicted: in every group, the variants whose keywords equal a recorded variant's keywords that this group knows. Unity picks a variant from the keywords enabled at the time
